OL,3,AStudents across England, Wales and
OL,4,ANorthern Ireland receive their GCSE and
OL,5,ABTec results
OL,6,
OL,7,FHundreds of thousands of students in
OL,8,FEngland, Wales and Northern Ireland are
OL,9,Fopening their GCSE, BTec and Cambridge
OL,10,FNationals results
OL,12,FResults were released at 08:00 BST -
OL,13,Fand from 11:00 BST, some pupils in
OL,14,FEngland can check them via an app for
OL,15,Fthe first time
OL,17,FAt one school in Derby, a red carpet
OL,18,Fhas been rolled out for students
OL,19,Farriving to receive their results
OL,23,APub: 20-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
